update public.species set body = $v$An undemanding schooler that thrives in cool, unheated tanks and even outdoor patio tubs. Peaceful and easy to breed: females carry a cluster of eggs for a few hours, then brush them onto fine-leaved plants. Available in orange, white, blue, and other gentle color forms.$v$ where slug = $v$medaka-ricefish$v$;
